summary:
  The Edit dialog looks for its row only by address, so a row a heal moved
  while the dialog was open is not found.

history:
  A heal writes the old address as prev. The dialog finds its row by the
  address it was opened on, and then by prev; without the second look the
  OK added the station a second time instead of editing the moved one.

target:
  package/contents/ui/DoorLogic.js

find:
      var tries = [["hostname", true], ["prev", true]];

replace:
      var tries = [["hostname", true]];

expect:
  Killed by tst_doorlogic::test_the_dialog_follows_its_row_through_a_heal_and_a_removal.
  Line-neutral.
